WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Shipping address
Enter the recipient’s details and choose the country, state and city to
request delivery options.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Compare the quoted methods
Choose the delivery method for this address. The example shows paid
delivery and free pickup. A preferred day does not override the quoted
price.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Review hosted payment options
This signed-in demo lists the payment methods configured for Paymob. The
provider confirms final eligibility on its own checkout page.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Review with Apple Pay
After selecting delivery, eligible signed-in shoppers can go directly to
review. Placing the order opens the store’s enrolled Apple Pay method on
Paymob. This capture simulates a supported device.

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Select delivery again after a changed quote
A changed quote returns the buyer to delivery with the address and cart
preserved. Review the updated methods before submitting again.
